## Task #17 — strengthened trio-leak pin.
##
## Source: docs/specs/system/zero_rust_stdlib_classes.spec.md (B5).
##
## Resolves `FooBar` through the `std._pin_zero_rust_stdlib.FooBar`
## namespace path — the same shape every other stdlib type uses
## (`std.io.File`, `std.fs.OpenOptions`, `std.net.TcpStream`).
## Pre-Task-17 this fails because the hand-maintained STD_SUBMODULES list
## in `resolve/stdlib/mod.rs` does not include the package, so
## `std._pin_zero_rust_stdlib` is not a known submodule even though
## `library/std/_pin_zero_rust_stdlib/src/lib.rx` is bootstrap-loaded.
## After Task #17 derives STD_SUBMODULES from BOOTSTRAP_FILES basenames,
## this resolves automatically.
use std._pin_zero_rust_stdlib.FooBar

def main
  let x = FooBar.new(42)
  let v = x.get
  if v == 42
    puts "ok"
  else
    puts "fail"
  end
end
